\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Spirit divine, attend our prayers
\par And make this house Thy home;
\par Descend with all Thy gracious powers;
\par O come, great Spirit, come!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Come as the light: to us reveal
\par Our emptiness and woe;
\par And lead us in those paths of life
\par Where all the righteous go.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Come as the fire, and purge our hearts 
\par Like sacrificial flame;
\par Let our whole soul an offering be
\par To our Redeemer's name.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Come as the dew, and sweetly bless
\par This consecrated hour
\par May barrenness rejoice to own
\par The fertilizing power.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. Come as the dove, and spread Thy wings,
\par The wings of peaceful love;
\par And let Thy Church on earth  become
\par Blest as the Church above.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 6. Come as the wind, with rushing sound 
\par And Pentecostal grace,
\par That all of woman born may see
\par The glory of Thy face.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 7\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 7. Spirit divine, attend our prayers;
\par Make a lost world Thy home;
\par Descend with all Thy gracious powers;
\par O come, great Spirit, come.\tab\tab 
\par                                 Amen.
\par \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2 
\par }

